	)
	(text "Because:\n- Remove excess debug for space\n- Not needed during running\n- Using expansion slots debug can be accessed\n  when needed\n- Faster clock, CANFD, IMU for future proofing\n- EEPROM for config flashing\n- Boot pad for space\n- Keeping jtag cuz goated\n- SD card for logging\n- temp sensor so board can have thermal shutoff/reg\n  the h7/f7 do have internal ones but they r shit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 75.946 67.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 255 153 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "579edff7-24f1-49d4-8e7e-dda1486d7fd4")
	)
	(text "Planned changes:\n- higher clock\n- smaller JTAG header (6 pin micro)\n- remove 7 seg\n- remove uart\n- change to CANFD/-+58V fault compat can trancivers\n- add transient protection to can trancivers\n- add rs232/3rd can \n- add sd card\n- fix grounding\n- add pads for boot\n- smaller rst button\n- faster clock\n- add temp sensor\n- add imu?\n- add eeprom\n- add header for expansion slot with\n  periherals and GPIO"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.988 51.562 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 255 153 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "94dda209-57c8-45db-8518-4085c62b09ba")
	)
